arStrings.szText:
Your {c_important}Catalyst{/c} now deals Lightning and or Sparking damage. Enemies damaged by it arc {c_random}{payload:DAMAGE_TOOLTIP}{/c} Lightning damage to a surrounding enemy. This effect can only happen on each enemy every {c_number}{SF_10}{/c} seconds.

While equipped, your Lightning Damage Bonus is equal to that of your highest Damage Type Bonus.{if:SF_6}

Deactivates monster {c_important}Suppressor{/c} effects for {c_number}{SF_4}{/c} seconds.{/if}
